# Backend security

Validate every request with Zod (or equivalent) on the server. Frontend validation is UX only.
Protect authenticated routes with auth middleware; admin routes require `role === 'admin'`.
Use Helmet, CORS allowlist (`CLIENT_URL`), and centralized error handling.
Never send stack traces in production. Never return `passwordHash` or raw API keys.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
res.status(500).json({ error: err.stack });

// ✅ GOOD
res.status(err.statusCode ?? 500).json({ error: { code, message, requestId } });